validns
------------------------------------------
DNS and DNSSEC zone file validator

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libJudy1-1.0.5-1
  libssl3-3.5.9-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  autoconf-20260320-3
  automake-20260320-2
  binutils-2.47-1
  cygport-0.37.12-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  libJudy-devel-1.0.5-1
  libssl-devel-3.5.9-1
  libtool-2.6.2-1
  make-4.4.1-2

Canonical website:
  https://codeberg.org/DNS-OARC/validns

Canonical download:
  https://www.dns-oarc.net/files/validns/validns-0.11.0.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack validns-0.11.0-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./validns-0.11.0-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/validns-0.11.0-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/validns-0.11.0-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(validns)
  /usr/bin/validns.exe
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/validns.README
  /usr/share/doc/validns/CHANGELOG.md
  /usr/share/doc/validns/LICENSE
  /usr/share/doc/validns/README.md
  /usr/share/doc/validns/TECHNICAL.md
  /usr/share/man/man1/validns.1.gz

